{"run_id":"run_740f41631d99","schema_version":"0.1","seq":11,"t_ms":11,"text":"Here's what the 2026 carrier rate card (res://docs/internal/carrier-rates-2026, internal) says:\n\n- **Pricing basis:** Rates are quoted per lane and reviewed every quarter.\n- **Fuel surcharges:** These follow the published regional fuel index, applied one month later.\n- **Lane codes:** Codes use the origin-destination-service format the company has used since 2024.\n\nThe document doesn't list any actual lanes, rates or surcharge percentages. If you need those figures, they're probably in a separate rate table or with the carrier management team. I can look for them if you'd like.","turn":3,"type":"agent.message"}
